WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.067
-All right, this year,

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.634
I'm sticking
to my New Year's resolutions.

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.467
I am saying yes to everything.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:07.467
[ Knocking ]

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:08.501
-Hey, Jimmy.
-Hey, Sarah.

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.167
-Do you think
I could get a raise?

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.167
-Yes.
-Yes!

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:16.300
-Hey, Jimbo,
you coming to my one-man show?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.834
It's Saturday at 8:00.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.534
-Yes.
-8:00 a.m.

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:23.534
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.300
[ Knocks ]
-Yo, Jimmy, The Roots and I

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.200
have decided we're gonna be
a kazoo band now.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.434
[ Kazoos play ]

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:34.968
That's not gonna be a problem,
is it?

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.234
-Yes.

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:37.868
-Yes, it's going to be
a problem,

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.901
or, yes, it's not
gonna be a problem?

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:43.067
-Yes?

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.634
-Ha!
You heard him, boys.

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:46.868
Polish those kazoos.
We got a show to do!

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:49.801
[ Kazoos playing ]

00:00:49.801 --> 00:00:52.100
-I did it.
I said yes to everything.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.133
It wasn't that bad.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:55.200
[ Cellphone vibrating ]

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.501
"Potential spam."
Hello?

00:00:57.501 --> 00:00:59.834
-Hi. Do you have a moment
to talk about

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:02.267
your car's extended warranty?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:05.634
-Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-Y--

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:06.634
Nooooo!

